"""Connectors PowerPoint routed itself, for :mod:`test_connectors` to hold the router to.

Measured with PowerPoint for Mac 16 through its AppleScript: two shapes made with
``make new shape``, a connector made with ``make new connector`` and attached with
``begin connect``/``end connect``, the deck saved and the connector's frame read back.  Each
row is::

    ((start preset, x, y, cx, cy), (end preset, x, y, cx, cy), start site, end site,
     (preset, x, y, cx, cy, rot, flipH, flipV, (adjust values in name order)))

Lengths are EMU.  Curved connectors are left out: between the same two sites PowerPoint
gave a curved connector exactly the elbow's frame and adjustments, every time.
"""

